      "content": "1 hours after SLEEP mode starts, temp will become about 4 O F lower than temp. setting. After another 1 hours, temp decrease about 4  O F further. After more another 3 hours, temp. rises about 2 O F further. The unit will run for further 3 hours then stops. Temp. is lower than temp. setting so that room temperature won't be too high for your sleep."
